1
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:09,040
What's wrong with you? Ever since you met
Night that day, you've been zoning out.

2
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:11,587
Did he do something to you or what?

3
00:00:12,747 --> 00:00:16,880
Night didn't do anything to me. He's a good guy.

4
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,485
Good guy my ass.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,098
Why are you badmouthing him?

6
00:00:23,945 --> 00:00:27,571
You don't even know him well.
Why are you judging him so fast?

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,433
And you know him well, huh?

8
00:00:35,079 --> 00:00:36,520
- Let's go.
- Come on.

9
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,040
We need the whole gang together.

10
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,440
Yeah yeah, what's with you guys?

11
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:43,114
- Why aren't you going? You don't have class tomorrow, right?
- Let's go.

12
00:00:44,299 --> 00:00:46,879
Hey, do you guys have some issue or what?

13
00:00:47,345 --> 00:00:50,617
No, I just see Earth looking tired, that's all.

14
00:00:51,398 --> 00:00:53,920
If he's tired then he SHOULD go.

15
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:57,326
I'm telling you, the place I'm taking you today—

16
00:00:58,170 --> 00:01:01,239
—it's insane.
All the stress you've had?

17
00:01:01,239 --> 00:01:04,626
You'll forget the word "stress"
for the rest of your life.

18
00:01:04,626 --> 00:01:07,450
I swear the happiness is
right in front of you.

19
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:11,200
Happiness… let's go.

